(https://github.com/herunan/herdr-over9k), Copyright (c) 2026 the Over9k
authors, MIT License.

pg-statusbar is a modified copy of the `workspace-status` mod shipped with the
Herdr app (version 0.1.15), which is licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0 (http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Changes: the usage
limits are drawn in the middle of the bar.

PG/layouts/PG.json is a modified copy of the `main` layout
shipped with the Herdr app (version 0.1.15), under the same Apache License,
Version 2.0. Changes: the status bar is pg-statusbar.

auto-title/mods/auto-title is an unmodified copy of the `mod/mods/auto-title`
folder of Herdr Auto Title (https://github.com/kryptamine/herdr-auto-title,
release 0.22.2), and auto-title/config.env is its config.env.example with one
setting changed, Copyright (c) 2026 Alexander Satretdinov, MIT License.

